Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:01.10,0:00:03.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,人世謂緣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:04.70,0:00:06.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,繫結的絲線糾結纏繞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:06.80,0:00:08.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,脆弱可悲的彼岸花
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:09.30,0:00:13.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,在憤怒 悲傷 淚水中度日
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:13.90,0:00:16.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,午夜零點的帷幕彼方
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:16.70,0:00:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,難消之恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:23.30,0:00:28.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}いつか{\K80}光{\K40}に向{\K40}か{\K60}う　{\K60\K30}逆{\K90}さまの{\K60}蝶
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:28.50,0:00:33.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}君{\K20}と{\K40}髪{\K50}を{\K30}切{\K60}る　{\K30\K80}鏡{\K40}の{\K100}中
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:33.70,0:00:39.10,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K60}授業{\K50}中{\K60}の{\K80}廊下　{\K80\K40}響{\K40}く{\K100}足音
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:39.40,0:00:44.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}絶{\K20}えず{\K30}雨{\K40}の{\K60}音{\K60}が　{\K20\K40}つい{\K50}て{\K40\K40}くる{\K50}よ
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:44.80,0:00:49.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}感{\K30}じ{\K45}る{\K45}まま{\K30}の{\K70\K60}形{\K40}は{\K60}眩{\K60}しい
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:50.00,0:00:55.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}甘{\K30}い{\K50}花{\K50}にな{\K80}る　{\K20\K30}毒{\K10}の{\K10}実{\K10}に{\K60}も{\K60}なる
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:00:55.30,0:01:00.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K40}今日{\K60}も{\K120}雨　{\K40\K40}あの{\K120}日と今{\K40}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:00.50,0:01:04.30,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}空{\K30}と{\K30}空{\K30}で{\K30}つ{\K60}なぎ{\K80}た{\K30}い{\K60}の
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:04.80,0:01:07.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:07.80,0:01:10.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:10.60,0:01:15.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:15.70,0:01:18.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\K20}In {\K30}this {\K60}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:18.20,0:01:20.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K160}ひとつの{\K60}思{\K30}い{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:21.10,0:01:26.40,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:26.70,0:01:29.00,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K20}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K30\K90}Uncertainty
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:29.10,0:01:31.70,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}一人{\K60}一人{\K40}の{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:31.90,0:01:37.20,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}か{\K50}に{\K40}残{\K40}せる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:37.40,0:01:39.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\K5}In {\K10}this {\K50}Craziness,{\K20\K40}You {\K40}gave me {\K20}life
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:39.90,0:01:42.50,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K140}それぞれの{\K60}形{\K30}を
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:01:42.70,0:01:47.60,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K30}僕{\K40}ら{\K50}は{\K30}どこ{\K40}ま{\K50}で{\K40}守{\K40}れる{\K60}だ{\K40}ろう{\K60}か
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:11.90,0:02:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這麼晚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:12.90,0:02:14.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你想餓死我嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:15.00,0:02:17.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 我馬上做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:22.00,0:02:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,難喫 重做去
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:24.70,0:02:26.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是 去學校會遲到的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:29.20,0:02:31.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管對這幫傢伙怎樣都無所謂麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:33.40,0:02:35.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki Pinki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:35.80,0:02:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我隨時都能殺了它們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:40.50,0:02:45.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,{\c&H0000FF&}被束縛的少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:54.80,0:02:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最近經常看見那孩子呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:57.10,0:02:58.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是剛搬來這附近的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:02:59.00,0:03:00.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不是啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:00.80,0:03:03.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她住在公園旁邊的大公寓裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:06.10,0:03:09.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過據說她在下野太太家學習
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:09.60,0:03:12.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,作爲交換每天去做飯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:14.40,0:03:16.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下野小姐能教書
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:17.20,0:03:18.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個人討厭小孩的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:19.40,0:03:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過下野太太以前是學校的老師啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:22.90,0:03:25.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,繼承了家人的財產後馬上就辭職了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:26.30,0:03:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她家人知道嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:28.90,0:03:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好像來打過一次招呼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:32.30,0:03:34.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過下野太太表面文章做得很好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:34.80,0:03:36.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,難不成被騙了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:37.00,0:03:38.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父母都上班到很晚
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:38.80,0:03:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只是想找個人看着孩子吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:41.60,0:03:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki Pinki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:53.00,0:03:54.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:03:58.50,0:03:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:00.40,0:04:01.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:01.70,0:04:04.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,剛纔你學校的老師來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:04.90,0:04:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我當然沒把他放在眼裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:08.10,0:04:09.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你說了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:10.40,0:04:12.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我什麼也沒說
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:12.50,0:04:14.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真的 真的和誰都沒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:14.60,0:04:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼都沒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:15.20,0:04:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我早說過你說了會怎麼樣吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:18.70,0:04:20.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我真的什麼也
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:19.70,0:04:22.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我說了可以隨時殺死它們的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:33.10,0:04:34.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 Yuki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:35.40,0:04:38.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,連墳墓都不能好好給你做
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:40.20,0:04:42.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,茶還沒好嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:42.80,0:04:43.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:47.40,0:04:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:50.20,0:04:51.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,二
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:53.10,0:04:54.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,三
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:55.10,0:04:56.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我馬上就來
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:04:55.50,0:04:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,四
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:08.30,0:05:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這搞笑藝人真有趣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:22.80,0:05:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:24.40,0:05:25.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:26.20,0:05:28.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個 時間已經…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:29.50,0:05:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 已經這麼晚了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:32.10,0:05:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:33.00,0:05:34.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,回去後要好好學習啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:35.40,0:05:38.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因爲我是你的家庭教師
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:38.40,0:05:39.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pinki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:38.80,0:05:41.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是你成績下降了被懷疑的可是我啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:42.80,0:05:43.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:44.20,0:05:45.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:05:49.60,0:05:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pinky
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:09.90,0:06:10.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我回來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:27.90,0:06:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:35.70,0:06:38.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是那時我沒鬆手的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:40.30,0:06:41.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起 Yuki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:42.40,0:06:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對不起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:54.00,0:06:56.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒想到她居然會真的下手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:06:57.60,0:07:00.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這樣下去 遲早Pinki也
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:01.10,0:07:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是誰
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:02.80,0:07:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有沒有人能
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:09.70,0:07:11.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,讓那傢伙下地獄去啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:23.40,0:07:24.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:30.80,0:07:31.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:38.50,0:07:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我會爲你報仇的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:52.20,0:07:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,美紀 還沒睡嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:54.80,0:07:55.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,媽媽
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:58.50,0:07:59.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爸爸呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:07:59.70,0:08:01.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,今晚不回來了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:01.50,0:08:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,啊 是這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:03.60,0:08:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki和Pinki還沒找到
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:07.10,0:08:09.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是嗎 還是放棄算了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:11.50,0:08:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我再稍微找找看
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:22.70,0:08:23.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿一
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:23.90,0:08:27.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早餐已經做好了 要好好喫啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:29.20,0:08:30.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我走了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:38.20,0:08:41.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是閻魔愛
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:43.30,0:08:44.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:47.80,0:08:48.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請收下
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:50.40,0:08:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你若真的要消除怨恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:54.90,0:08:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,將這紅線解開即可
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:08:55.20,0:08:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 喂 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:00.20,0:09:02.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你又看見了吧 鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:02.70,0:09:04.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,稻草人已經給了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:04.70,0:09:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,到底在哪裏呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:06.80,0:09:10.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鶇 有沒有能判斷地點的標記
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:10.60,0:09:13.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,特殊的建築或者 商店名字什麼的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:15.90,0:09:18.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,又有人要被送去地獄了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:18.90,0:09:19.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:20.20,0:09:22.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你一定要阻止嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:26.00,0:09:26.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,當然
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:32.00,0:09:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是個好找的地方啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:36.60,0:09:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是這家嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:09:41.60,0:09:42.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下野
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:07.20,0:10:08.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是母親嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:14.40,0:10:17.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,下野太太 她是一個人生活的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:18.60,0:10:20.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她沒孩子的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:20.40,0:10:23.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,繼承了家人的大筆財產
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:23.70,0:10:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不工作就呆在家裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:26.10,0:10:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道在幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:28.20,0:10:31.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,年輕的時候好像也和很多人交往過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:31.60,0:10:34.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒聽說她結婚啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:34.70,0:10:36.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,搞錯人家了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:37.00,0:10:38.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是不是那孩子的事呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:38.90,0:10:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最近出入下野家的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:42.50,0:10:43.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個孩子啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:43.60,0:10:45.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,以前經帶狗散步的孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:10:46.40,0:10:48.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,從公園旁邊的公寓過來的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:03.50,0:11:04.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:07.70,0:11:08.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了Pinki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:09.20,0:11:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒精神啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:10.60,0:11:12.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是因爲Yuki沒有了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:12.50,0:11:16.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們該不會想一起逃走吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:16.30,0:11:17.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這腳是因爲誰的錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:18.10,0:11:20.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,敢逃走我決不饒你
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:21.30,0:11:24.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我隨時都可以弄死它
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:24.60,0:11:25.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:11:32.00,0:11:34.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也隨時都可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:04.90,0:12:06.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,從那起過了三天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:06.40,0:12:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一點動靜也沒有嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:08.80,0:12:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子到底在想什麼呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:10.90,0:12:13.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,輪入道一定很無聊了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:14.00,0:12:15.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也不見得
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:16.50,0:12:20.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那孩子每天都對着我說着同樣的話
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:23.40,0:12:26.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我也隨時都可以
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:37.50,0:12:40.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,給 這就是您委託的調查結果
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:41.10,0:12:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,, 謝謝了 幫了大忙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:45.40,0:12:47.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上川美紀 初中一年級
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:48.70,0:12:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最近身邊沒有突然死亡或者失蹤的人 啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:55.30,0:12:56.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放棄復仇了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:57.30,0:12:57.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還是
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:12:58.30,0:12:59.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狗倒是有
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:01.30,0:13:01.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,狗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:02.00,0:13:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有狗失蹤了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:09.40,0:13:11.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,自從搬到這裏
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:11.50,0:13:15.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早晚帶狗散步成了她的日常習慣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:21.60,0:13:23.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,在學校並不出衆
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:23.30,0:13:25.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也沒有要好的朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:25.70,0:13:28.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,父母都因爲工作常常不在家
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:28.90,0:13:30.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只有兩條狗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:30.90,0:13:32.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纔是她的知心朋友
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:39.50,0:13:41.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,但是兩個星期前
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:41.40,0:13:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,散步途中狗就失蹤了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:44.10,0:13:45.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,直到現在
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:46.50,0:13:48.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,正好從那時起
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:48.20,0:13:51.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,她就開始出入這間房子了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:13:52.00,0:13:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這之間應該有聯繫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:05.80,0:14:06.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我說過了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:07.00,0:14:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你敢對人說我就把狗殺了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:10.30,0:14:12.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,最近有個可疑的男人經常出沒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:12.90,0:14:14.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你說出去了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:14.30,0:14:16.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知道 我不知道那個人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:16.60,0:14:18.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是沒遵守約定的你不好
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:19.20,0:14:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我馬上把它殺了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:20.30,0:14:22.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等 等等啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:27.60,0:14:28.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,解開繩線
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:29.50,0:14:32.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,就和我正式締結了契約
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:33.50,0:14:37.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你怨恨的人將立刻墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:39.20,0:14:39.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:40.40,0:14:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怨恨若已消除
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:42.30,0:14:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你自身亦將付出代價
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:45.60,0:14:47.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,害人終害己
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:48.00,0:14:49.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你死後
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:49.80,0:14:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,靈魂亦將墜入地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:14:54.70,0:14:56.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這幫傢伙是怎麼回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:06.10,0:15:07.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,當媽媽了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:27.90,0:15:29.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pin Pinki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:34.80,0:15:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:36.20,0:15:36.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我說過了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:37.50,0:15:38.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要殺了這狗
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:39.00,0:15:40.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pinki Pinki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:40.90,0:15:43.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,快給我做早飯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:43.20,0:15:44.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我肚子餓了啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:43.20,0:15:44.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好疼 好疼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:44.90,0:15:47.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 住手
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:45.10,0:15:50.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不該不會是想餓死我再奪走我的財產吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:53.50,0:15:54.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:55.20,0:15:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼會變成這樣
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:15:57.60,0:15:58.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那天
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:02.20,0:16:04.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,只不過是想換換心情
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:04.70,0:16:07.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,改變了散步的路線而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:08.10,0:16:10.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki Pinki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:11.40,0:16:12.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:16.10,0:16:17.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,等等
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:20.30,0:16:22.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki Pinki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:24.00,0:16:25.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,疼 疼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:26.10,0:16:28.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放開 喂 好疼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:28.70,0:16:29.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Yuki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:30.60,0:16:31.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是你的狗嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:32.20,0:16:33.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把我的院子弄得一團糟
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:34.00,0:16:36.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,還咬傷我的腿
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:36.40,0:16:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不能原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:37.50,0:16:39.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你要給我負責
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:41.50,0:16:44.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,因爲聽說咬人狗會被處理
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:44.30,0:16:46.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,才一直唯命是從
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:47.10,0:16:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不知不覺Yuki和Pinki就好像變成了人質似的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:51.20,0:16:53.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,問了老師說根本就沒有這會事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:53.31,0:16:55.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也有被處理的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:55.40,0:16:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有病的狗之類
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:16:57.30,0:17:00.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,早知道這樣我一開始和媽媽商量就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:01.00,0:17:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,雖然媽媽說不喜歡狗 商量一下的話一定…
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:04.10,0:17:05.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不會讓你去商量的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:06.20,0:17:10.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你敢說的話 這次是這羣傢伙一隻只死掉
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:14.70,0:17:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,明白了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:26.20,0:17:27.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,爲什麼那個時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:30.50,0:17:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是那樣的話 Pinki就
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:43.60,0:17:44.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,給 換的衣服
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:45.30,0:17:46.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,哦 謝謝
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:46.50,0:17:48.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,阿一好臭啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:48.60,0:17:50.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,好幾天沒洗澡了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:51.40,0:17:52.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,有那麼臭嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:53.30,0:17:56.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過 我不能不盯着那孩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:17:58.10,0:18:00.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是那個樣子 大概可以放心了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:03.40,0:18:04.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,來過了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:05.20,0:18:06.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:08.40,0:18:09.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:09.70,0:18:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,地獄少女做的事情是壞事嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:13.40,0:18:15.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,奪走他人的生命的行爲
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:15.50,0:18:17.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管有什麼理由也不能原諒
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:18.60,0:18:21.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可是世上有人做了更壞的事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:22.00,0:18:24.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,也若無其事的吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:24.80,0:18:26.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那是沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:26.80,0:18:29.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些人又由誰來懲罰呢
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:29.90,0:18:32.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那和這個不是一回事
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:32.30,0:18:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,是這樣嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:36.90,0:18:37.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,鶇
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:41.80,0:18:43.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請問是哪位
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:43.80,0:18:45.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我是車站附近的駐警
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:45.80,0:18:46.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,警察
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:46.90,0:18:49.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,果然你那個時候看見了吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:49.60,0:18:52.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊 我什麼也不知道
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:52.30,0:18:53.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要殺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:54.00,0:18:54.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:55.10,0:18:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我要殺
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:57.60,0:18:59.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,上川 喂上川 
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:58.70,0:18:59.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,把門打開
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:18:59.90,0:19:00.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:01.40,0:19:02.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我的學生在裏面慘叫
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:03.40,0:19:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這旁
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:09.60,0:19:12.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,請求支援 地點是柴田街八號
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:16.00,0:19:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再不快點 小傢伙們就
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:18.30,0:19:19.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們想幹什麼
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:21.80,0:19:24.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你們也在打我財產的主意吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:25.00,0:19:26.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不會讓你們得逞的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:26.90,0:19:31.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那個人殺死了我養的Yuki和Pinki
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:31.20,0:19:32.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我不會交給任何人的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:33.40,0:19:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 我會控告你妨礙警務
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:35.80,0:19:37.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,放開我 我不會給你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:38.10,0:19:40.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,一分錢也不會給你的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:48.70,0:19:52.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可惡 放開我 放開我
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:19:56.80,0:20:01.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,看來她以爲女孩看見了她孩子的屍骨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:01.80,0:20:02.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以就
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:02.90,0:20:06.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,即便把財產給孩子也不願意嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:08.00,0:20:09.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,真可怕
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:13.70,0:20:16.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,這是地獄少女給你的人偶吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:20.50,0:20:23.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,對你來說已經沒用了 對吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:26.40,0:20:27.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些小傢伙們
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:28.70,0:20:29.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,那些小傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:32.30,0:20:33.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:34.00,0:20:35.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,纔剛剛出生而已
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:36.20,0:20:38.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,連名字都還沒取
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:39.50,0:20:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是早點把那人送下地獄就好了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:42.30,0:20:43.90,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,我明明隨時都可以做到的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:42.70,0:20:44.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,住手 住手啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:20:54.40,0:20:57.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怨 恨 已 聞
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:01.90,0:21:05.30,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,殺了父母纔好不容易得到的財產
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:05.60,0:21:08.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,怎麼能交給小孩
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:08.60,0:21:10.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,所以就殺了嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:10.30,0:21:10.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沒錯
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:11.70,0:21:13.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,妨礙我的傢伙
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:13.90,0:21:15.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不管是狗還是什麼我都要殺了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:16.00,0:21:18.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不過即使習慣殺害了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:18.40,0:21:20.10,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,被殺還是頭一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:28.80,0:21:31.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,迷失於黑暗中的可悲之影
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:31.90,0:21:34.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,傷害 鄙視他人
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:34.80,0:21:37.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,沉溺於罪惡的孽魂
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:39.50,0:21:41.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,來死一次吧
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:54.80,0:21:57.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,可不是去什麼地獄的時候
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:21:57.40,0:21:59.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,再不趕快回去財產就
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:00.20,0:22:04.00,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,你知道自己是什麼樣子嗎
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:04.50,0:22:05.60,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,什麼啊
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:11.40,0:22:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,不要
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:11.40,0:22:12.50,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,此怨此恨
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:14.00,0:22:15.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,將流向地獄
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:33.80,0:22:35.80,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,要是再早點解開繩子
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:36.10,0:22:37.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,Pinki就不會死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:38.60,0:22:40.40,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,小狗們也都不會死了
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:47.10,0:22:50.20,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,隨時… 明明隨時可以做到的
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:22:55.70,0:22:59.70,Default,,0000,0000,0000,,君之怨恨 願爲消之
Dialogue: Marked=0,0:23:14.20,0:23:19.90,*Default,NTP,0000,0000,0000,,{\fad(200,200)\fn华文细黑\K20}い{\K30}つ{\K30}だっ{\K200}て　{\K30}行{\K30}き{\K30}止{\K30}まり{\K200}で
